  m_Name: GItem_VerticalFarm
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: VoxelEngine::VoxelEngine.GridSystem.GridBlockItem
  itemId: gitem_verticalfarm
  displayName: Vertical Farm Plot
  description: 'Ship-mounted vertical farm. Nine growing cells stacked in three trays,
    for a hull where floor space is the scarce thing. Needs grid power, water through
    a liquid port, and breathable air - a sealed breathable room or a breathable
    world under the hull. Crops pause without air instead of dying, and ripe beds
    are moved into connected grid cargo. No trees: a tray has no room for roots or
    canopy.'
